## Model card

- **Name:** MiniMax M3.1 Flash Preview (unverified)
- **Short description:** No verified public model found behind the name "MiniMax M3.1 Flash Preview". The MiniMaxAI HuggingFace org (21 models, fetched 2026-09-28) lists MiniMax-M3 (427B, Jul 2026), M3-MXFP8, M2.7, M2.5, M2.1, H3, and Music3 — no M3.1 or M3.1-Flash; HF full-text search for "MiniMax-M3.1" returns only M2.x quantization/finetune derivatives; the OpenCode Zen curated docs and its live `zen/v1/models` endpoint (fetched 2026-09-28) list minimax-m3, m2.7, and m2.5 but no m3.1. The folder's `meta.json` (orchestrator-curated) describes a preview-tier multimodal coding model with 1M context and "no public benchmarks or price yet", but no public card, weight release, or benchmark could be independently verified.
- **Provider / access:** unknown; presumed MiniMax Open Platform (MiniMax Code / Token Plan per `meta.json`) — no verified host or API ID.
- **Release / knowledge:** no verified release date found; the latest verified MiniMax release is MiniMax-M3 (July 2026).
- **IDs:** no verified public ID found (no Free ID exists on Zen)
- **Context window:** no verified public figure found (`meta.json` claims 1M total, unverified against any public source).
- **Modalities:** no verified public figure found (`meta.json` claims text/image/video in, text out, unverified).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-28):** no verified public pricing found (`meta.json`: MiniMax Code / Token Plan only, no public per-token price).
- **Architecture:** no verified public figure found; the MiniMax family's latest verified open release is MiniMax-M3, a 427B MoE (HF `MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M3`).

